Package: zapretgui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Zapret <noreply@zapret.moe>
Depends: nftables, systemd, libluajit-5.1-2, zlib1g, libnetfilter-queue1, libnfnetlink0, libmnl0, libcap2, libxcb-cursor0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libegl1, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1, polkitd | policykit-1, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://wiki.zapret.moe/
Description: Zapret: bypass of network blocks with a window
 Presets, tray icon, DNS settings and checks on top of zapret2 (nfqws2).
 The window runs as the normal user; a small root service (zapretgui-helper)
 owns the firewall table "inet zapretgui" and the engine.
